      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The prioritization of political messaging in contemporary art is a deeply divisive trend, but it fundamentally redefines what \"value\" means in the art world. Art's function has shifted from purely aesthetic contemplation to active social commentary, making its political impact its primary measure of worth. This shift forces viewers to engage critically with the socio-political landscape, which is a vital, if uncomfortable, function of modern culture.",
