    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a pretty strong way to put it. so you're basically saying that if an artist's goal is to challenge power, then technical mastery or beauty is less important? it just seems like a really one-sided way to look at it, especially for people who value the craft itself.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
