      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The idea that craft is inherently \"less important\" is a false dichotomy; rather, the *goal* dictates the hierarchy of value. When the objective is dismantling oppressive structures, the message becomes the primary engine of meaning, rendering traditional aesthetic perfection secondary. Valuing craft above all else is simply valuing the status quo, which is precisely what critical art seeks to disrupt.",
      "source": "target",
